  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Be\u015Flisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nBu kart, hem kendinle hem de d\u0131\u015F d\xFCnya ile s\u0131k\u0131
    bir m\xFCcadeleye giri\u015Fti\u011Fini anlat\u0131yor. \xD6n\xFCn\xFC kesmek
    ya da umutlar\u0131n\u0131 \xE7almak isteyen insanlar olmu\u015F. Onlara, b\xF6ld\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    ekme\u011Finden, zaman\u0131ndan, hatta sevginden vermi\u015Fsin. S\u0131ra ki\u015Fili\u011Finden
    \xF6d\xFCn vermeye geldi\u011Finde ise, orada \"Dur!\" demi\u015Fsin. Gerekti\u011Finde
    baz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 kendi s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131na geri yollam\u0131\u015F,
    yapmak zorunda oldu\u011Funda da onlar\u0131n alanlar\u0131na girip yetkilerini
    ellerinden alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n {{isim}}. Neticede \xE7evrendeki d\xFC\u015Fmanlarla
    meselelerinin \xE7o\u011Funu halletmi\u015F, en zorlusu \"nefsinle\" ba\u015F
    ba\u015Fa kalm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
